<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">🎯 每周上冰目标（可选）</view>
    <view class="muted"><text class="b">不设也完全不影响使用</text> —— 设了才会在首页出现进度条。只统计上冰时长（陆地是辅助，不计入）。</view>
    <view class="goal-row">
      <input class="input goal-input" type="number" value="{{goal}}" bindinput="setGoal" placeholder="例如 360" />
      <text class="goal-unit">分钟 / 周</text>
    </view>
    <view class="goal-chips">
      <view class="chip {{goal == item ? 'on' : ''}}" wx:for="{{goalPresets}}" wx:key="*this" data-v="{{item}}" bindtap="quickGoal">{{item}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="btn-row">
      <button class="btn goal-btn-full" bindtap="saveGoal">保存目标</button>
    </view>
    <view class="goal-clear" wx:if="{{goal}}" bindtap="clearGoal">不设目标（去掉首页那条进度）</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">🥾 冰鞋 / 装备</view>
    <view class="muted">填一双鞋的启用到退役日期，自动算出「滑了多少小时」、平均每周、距上次磨刀多少天。</view>
    <view class="nav-row" bindtap="goGear">
      <text class="nav-t">打开装备页</text>
      <text class="nav-go">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">📈 次数基线（开始记录前已录的次数）</view>
    <view class="muted">早期记录不全时，填上这个基线，让「回顾」里的累计「上冰/上课」次数更准确。</view>
    <view class="goal-row">
      <view class="base-lb">上冰基线</view>
      <input class="input goal-input" type="number" value="{{iceBase}}" bindinput="setIceBase" placeholder="0" />
    </view>
    <view class="goal-row">
      <view class="base-lb">上课基线</view>
      <input class="input goal-input" type="number" value="{{lessonBase}}" bindinput="setLessonBase" placeholder="0" />
    </view>
    <button class="btn goal-btn-full" bindtap="saveBase">保存基线</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">☁️ 云同步</view>
    <view class="kv">
      <text class="kv-label">当前身份</text>
      <text class="kv-val">{{openid || '获取中…'}}</text>
      <text class="copy-link" wx:if="{{openid}}" bindtap="copyOpenid">复制</text>
    </view>
    <view class="kv" wx:if="{{aiVisible}}"><text class="kv-label">AI 教练</text><text class="kv-val">{{aiStatus}}</text></view>
    <view class="kv"><text class="kv-label">上次同步</text><text class="kv-val">{{syncStatus}}</text></view>
    <view class="kv"><text class="kv-label">数据在哪</text><text class="kv-val">{{dataWhere}}</text></view>
    <view class="sync-err" wx:if="{{syncErr}}">
      <text>⚠️ {{syncErr}}</text>
      <text class="sync-retry" bindtap="retryUpload">立即重试上传</text>
    </view>
    <view class="muted dev-note">删除小程序会清空本机数据；重新打开时会自动从云端恢复（前提是之前上传成功过）。所以别只依赖本机，重要数据请定期「导出为文件」。</view>
    <view class="share-block">
      <view class="muted">分享图里放什么：练了什么、教练说的要点一定会有；下面两项默认不放（可能是不想公开的信息）。</view>
      <view class="auto-row">
        <view class="auto-info"><view class="auto-t">训练时长</view><view class="muted">把「多少分钟」画进分享图</view></view>
        <switch checked="{{shareDuration}}" bindchange="toggleShareField" data-k="duration" color="#0284c7" />
      </view>
      <view class="auto-row">
        <view class="auto-info"><view class="auto-t">教练名字</view><view class="muted">把「教练：XXX」画进分享图</view></view>
        <switch checked="{{shareCoach}}" bindchange="toggleShareField" data-k="coach" color="#0284c7" />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="kv tappable" wx:if="{{remindOn}}" bindtap="setupReminder">
      <text class="kv-label">🔔 考级提醒</text><text class="kv-val">{{remindText}} ▾</text>
    </view>

    <view class="auto-row">
      <view class="auto-info">
        <view class="auto-title">自动同步</view>
        <view class="muted auto-sub">保持开启：改动几秒后自动上传云端，删小程序/换手机时能恢复</view>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{auto}}" bindchange="toggleAuto" color="#0284c7" />
    </view>
    <view class="btn-row">
      <button class="ghost-btn half" bindtap="cloudPull">☁️ 从云端恢复（合并）</button>
      <button class="ghost-btn half" bindtap="overview">📊 数据概览</button>
    </view>
    <view class="muted pull-hint">「从云端恢复」只补不删，随时可以点，点了不会丢任何东西。</view>
    <view class="diag" bindtap="rollback">⏮ 找回云端历史版本</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">💾 数据备份 / 迁移</view>
    <view class="muted">「导出」生成一份 JSON 备份或迁移到其它设备；「导入」可合并网页版 / 其它设备的备份。</view>
    <view class="btn-row">
      <button class="ghost-btn half" bindtap="exportFile">💾 导出备份</button>
      <button class="ghost-btn half" bindtap="importBackup">📥 导入备份</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{showImport}}">
      <view class="muted">粘贴 JSON 备份内容（会自动合并去重）：</view>
      <textarea class="textarea" value="{{importText}}" bindinput="setImportText" placeholder="粘贴 JSON 备份内容…" maxlength="-1"></textarea>
      <view class="btn-row">
        <button class="ghost-btn half" bindtap="toggleImport">收起</button>
        <button class="btn half" bindtap="doImport">导入</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 历史笔记是"一次性搬家"，跟日常备份不是一回事，所以单独一张卡 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">📝 把旧笔记搬进来</view>
    <view class="muted">微信收藏 / 备忘录里攒了几年的训练笔记，按日期搬进来。可以<text class="b">复制提示词让你自己的 AI 先转格式</text>，再粘回来。</view>
    <view class="muted">默认<text class="b">计入上冰天数 / 次数</text>；正文里写了「90 分钟 / 1.5 小时 / 2 节」的，会照抄成时长（没写就是 0 分钟）。也可以切成「只当笔记」。</view>
    <view class="nav-row" bindtap="goImportHist">
      <text class="nav-t">打开历史笔记导入</text>
      <text class="nav-go">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="adv-toggle" bindtap="toggleAdv">{{advOn ? '▾' : '▸'}} 🔧 高级 / 数据排查（平时不用）</view>
    <block wx:if="{{advOn}}">
      <view class="muted">这里都是排查与修复工具，日常使用不需要。操作前建议先「导出为文件」备份。</view>
      <view class="guard {{guardOk ? 'ok' : 'bad'}}">{{guardText}}</view>
      <view class="btn-row">
        <button class="ghost-btn half" bindtap="diagnose">🔍 同步诊断</button>
        <button class="ghost-btn half" bindtap="extras">🔎 多出的记录</button>
      </view>
      <view class="btn-row">
        <button class="ghost-btn half" bindtap="restoreRecords">↩︎ 恢复导入前</button>
        <button class="ghost-btn half" bindtap="copyExamsRaw">📋 复制考级原始数据</button>
      </view>
      <view class="btn-row">
        <button class="ghost-btn" bindtap="dedupeRecords">🧹 合并重复记录（同日期+同类型+同方式）</button>
      </view>
      <view class="btn-row">
        <button class="ghost-btn" bindtap="restoreUpgrade">⬆︎ 恢复升级前数据<text wx:if="{{snapText}}">（{{snapText}}）</text></button>
        <button class="ghost-btn" bindtap="repairMoves">🔧 修复动作库（找回丢掉的组合）</button>
      </view>
      <view class="danger-zone">
        <view class="muted">下面两个操作会「覆盖或清掉」数据，普通使用不需要；点之前请先「导出为文件」。</view>
        <view class="btn-row">
          <button class="ghost-btn danger half" bindtap="cloudUpload">⬆️ 用本机覆盖云端</button>
          <button class="ghost-btn danger half" bindtap="clearData">🧨 清空本机数据</button>
        </view>
        <view class="muted">· 「用本机覆盖云端」= 把云端那份换成你本机现在的样子（云端旧版会自动存进历史，可回滚）<br/>· 「清空本机数据」= 只清本机，云端那份还在，之后可以点「从云端恢复」拉回来</view>
      </view>
    </block>

    <view class="ver-line">当前版本 {{ver}}{{recN ? " · 本机 " + recN + " 条记录" : ""}}</view>
  </view>
</view>
